# Taster of Wares: with nothing in the target opponent's hand, nothing is revealed and nothing is exiled (CR 701.20a, 608.2d). Bot2
# casts and plays everything it holds on turn 2 (Lightning Bolt at Bot1's face, Bot1 20 -> 17), so on turn 3 the enter ability
# asks no one anything and the game goes on.

